// Voice/Chat form-interview workflow upgrade: the canonical coverage manifest for the interview
// contract (docs/ai/form-interview-contract.md). This is the single source of truth
// tests/form-interview-coverage-manifest.test.mjs checks every real Process Registry registration
// against - generated by reading the actual `registry.register('<id>', {...})` call sites in
// navrya-src, never guessed from a form's name or from this product brief's own prose.
//
// Each entry's key is the literal string portion of the real registration call (for a
// per-instance id built as `'prefix-' + entity.id`, that is just the literal prefix, e.g.
// `'account-detail-'` for `registry.register('account-detail-' + account.id, {...})`).
//
// status:
//   'interviewable' - declares a real `interview: { fields: [...] }` (canonical display order,
//                      labels, types, options, visibleWhen, roles) - Voice/Chat can run it as a
//                      full natural interview. `sourceFile` names the real registration.
//   'excluded'       - deliberately never interview-fillable: a payment/credential/admin surface,
//                       a destructive-only confirmation gate, or an empty-allowlist context marker
//                       with no field to ever ask about. `reason` is mandatory and explains why.
//   'pending'        - a real, safe, already-fillable form (live field-sync already works exactly
//                       as it did before this pass) that has not yet been migrated to carry
//                       canonical interview metadata (display order/labels/visibleWhen). Voice/Chat
//                       can still fill it field-by-field as it always could; it just does not yet
//                       get deterministic ordering/labels for the interview engine. `reason` names
//                       this honestly as a real, acknowledged gap, never silently as "excluded".
//
// tests/form-interview-coverage-manifest.test.mjs fails if:
//   - a real `registry.register(...)` call site exists in navrya-src with no entry here at all;
//   - an 'interviewable' entry's own real registration does not actually declare `interview:`;
//   - any entry is missing its required fields (reason for excluded/pending, sourceFile for
//     interviewable).
